1.0.0 public release
1.0.1 Added options(useFancyQuotes = FALSE, scipen = 999) to the top of startModule() to prevent some position ids from being stored in scientific notation.
1.0.1 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to work with genomes with lower case NTs (needed for hs1).
1.0.2 Added additional data fields to multiHitCluster output.
1.0.2 Added --multiHitMinConnectionReads and --multiHitMaxSplitCandidates to buildStdFragments to allow splitting of sub-networks.
1.0.2 Updated module flag help lines. 
1.0.3 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to include leader sequences when applying synthetic error.
1.0.3 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to include --illuminaReadIDs flag to export simulated Illumina read IDs rather than diagnostic read ids.
1.0.3 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to include --posidFile flag to generate user specific positions. 
1.0.3 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to include --repeatTable, --repeatClasses, and --repeatGrouping flags to create synthetic sites enriched in repeat elements.
1.0.3 Added new module annotateMultiHitRepeats to annotate multiHitRepeat cluster objects created by the buildStandardFragments module.
1.0.3 Updated buildStandardFragments to include additional data columns to track additional cluster details.
1.0.3 Updated buildStandardFragments to include options to inspect sub-clusters within larger clusters connected by n reads defined by --multiHitMinConnectionReads; additional data files generated.
1.0.4 Updated launcher issues from previous 1.0.3.
1.0.5 Updated validateSampleData module to allow mode = AAV for future AAV functionality.
1.0.5 Corrected demultiplex documentation regarding --autoBarcodeOrt behavior.
